{"duration_api_ms":157910,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"6b84889b-2cbe-43c3-824f-b86e9bcc10ac","total_cost_usd":0.209046,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":14873,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":14955,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":10222},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":14873,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":14955,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":14873,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":14873},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-sonnet-5":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":14955,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":14873,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.209046,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":64000,"thinkingTokens":10222,"canonicalModel":"claude-sonnet-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"is_error":false,"num_turns":1,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"{\"observation\":\"Every non-dominated point comes from one family: D=3.38, bluntness 1.2, cone 69.9, with only flight-path angle varying. Flux runs from 227.7k to 274.7k W/m2 and bondline temperature from 418 K down to 391.4 K. The front ends where max_g hits its limit of about 12 (margin 0.003 at gamma -3.55). Diameter is capped near 3.385 m by the heatshield mass fraction (margin 0.003 at 3.38, 0.0089 at 3.37, 0.106 at 3.2). Bluntness and cone are pinned by the aero surrogate hull and the geometry validity limit. Cone 69.0 with b 1.2, b 1.25 with cone 69.9, and b 1.22 with cone 70 all failed on extrapolation. Smaller-b, lower-cone points such as C-ba66a1b43adf and C-e96a6ca1ed89 have higher flux at the same gamma and are dominated. Steep-gamma points are all g-infeasible.\",\"evidence\":[\"C-e4bcd37fa904: gamma -3.55, flux 274.7k, T 391.37, g margin 0.003, mass margin 0.003. This is the low-T corner of the front.\",\"C-2ca095c82fd6 (D 3.37) has slightly worse flux and T than the D 3.38 curve, so larger D is better and only the mass limit stops it.\",\"C-ba66a1b43adf and C-e96a6ca1ed89 at gamma -3.5 have flux 282k and 294k against 273.5k for b 1.2, so lower bluntness raises flux.\",\"C-2375647d7e43, C-a554636d8035 and C-bcce2808c9b8 failed on cd_fore extrapolation, so the safe (b, cone) region is narrow around (1.2, 69.9).\",\"C-602600f85327 (D 3.2, gamma -4.2) has g 13.0 and C-2d91d8d713d7 has g 19.2, so g is set mostly by gamma and any gamma steeper than about -3.6 is infeasible.\"],\"mechanism\":\"This draws on data and on prior Allen-Eggers-type reasoning. Peak flux scales roughly as sqrt(sin(gamma)/(Rn*CdA)), so large D and large bluntness are best. Bondline T falls as the pulse shortens at steeper gamma. Peak g rises with gamma, which caps gamma near -3.57. The front is therefore a one-parameter curve in gamma. It is convex, so extra points between existing ones add a little hypervolume. The remaining gains are the last few hundredths of a degree of gamma, D just under the mass-fraction limit, and a small (b, cone) probe at the edge of the hull, where cone 70 or b 1.21 might lower flux.\",\"uncertainty\":\"I cannot see the hull of the cd_fore surrogate, so the cone 70 and b 1.21 probes may fail with an extrapolation error. Peak g at gamma -3.57 has only about 0.3% margin, so those points may fall just over the limit. Mass-fraction margin versus D is extrapolated linearly. Predicted values are linear interpolations along the gamma curve.\",\"proposals\":[{\"parent_id\":\"C-e4bcd37fa904\",\"rationale\":\"Push gamma to the g limit (margin 0.003 at -3.55, about 1.3 g/deg slope, so -3.57 gives g about 11.99).\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.57},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":275200,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":391.2,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Extends the low-T end of the front by a small amount.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-e4bcd37fa904\",\"rationale\":\"Raise D just under the mass-fraction limit (zero margin near 3.385 m) and go to gamma -3.57.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.383,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.57},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":274900,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":391.1,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Tests whether D can be pushed to the mass limit for a small gain in both objectives.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-c99d80679c13\",\"rationale\":\"Probe cone 70.0 (the bound) at b 1.2. It may lie inside the hull and give slightly more drag area.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"cone_half_angle_deg\":70.0},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":273000,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":391.9,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"high\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Checks the hull edge; if it is valid the cone bound is a free small improvement.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-42ea83f50d6b\",\"rationale\":\"Same cone 70.0 probe at mid-gamma, to see whether the cone effect is consistent.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"cone_half_angle_deg\":70.0},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":261000,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":397.1,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"high\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Separates a hull failure at cone 70 from a gamma-specific failure.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-9d4af6f8c498\",\"rationale\":\"Cone 70.0 at gamma -2.0, to fill the front in the low-flux region.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"cone_half_angle_deg\":70.0,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.0},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":238000,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":410.1,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"high\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Tests the cone 70 effect at the shallow end.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-23d2ccca7fea\",\"rationale\":\"Cone 70.0 at the shallowest gamma, to see whether the lowest-flux corner can improve.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"cone_half_angle_deg\":70.0},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":227700,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":418.0,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"high\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"The lowest-flux corner has the most hypervolume leverage.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-c99d80679c13\",\"rationale\":\"Small bluntness increase to 1.21 with cone 70. Flux falls with bluntness, but b 1.22 with cone 70 failed at D 3.3.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"bluntness_ratio\":1.21,\"cone_half_angle_deg\":70.0},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":271500,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":392.0,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"high\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Locates the hull boundary in bluntness with a small step.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-c99d80679c13\",\"rationale\":\"Bluntness 1.21 at cone 69.9, to isolate the bluntness effect from the cone effect.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"bluntness_ratio\":1.21},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":271500,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":392.0,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"high\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Tells the loop whether b above 1.2 is reachable at all.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-95bbbbd26d11\",\"rationale\":\"Fill a gap in the front at gamma -1.8. The front curve is convex, so interpolated points add hypervolume.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-1.8},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":233800,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":413.1,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Cheap coverage of the trade-off curve.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-e50b95400c8a\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap at gamma -2.0.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.0},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":238100,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":410.1,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Coverage of the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-cfaebb7a9bc7\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap at gamma -2.4.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.4},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":247200,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":404.5,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Coverage of the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-7a18d25f8e9a\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap at gamma -2.6.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.6},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":251900,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":401.9,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Coverage of the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-3e22ce42988c\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap at gamma -2.8.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.8},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":256700,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":399.4,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Coverage of the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-3dfb47a1c8a3\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap at gamma -3.25.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.25},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":267500,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":394.4,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Coverage of the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-c7acc697d292\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap at gamma -3.35.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.35},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":269900,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":393.4,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Coverage of the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-c99d80679c13\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap at gamma -3.45.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.45},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":272300,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":392.4,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Coverage of the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-4fed711799a1\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap at gamma -1.55, near the lowest-flux end.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-1.55},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":228700,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":417.2,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Coverage of the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-c99d80679c13\",\"rationale\":\"Bluntness 1.15 with cone kept at 69.9. Tests how flux depends on bluntness at a large cone angle, with possible hull risk.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"bluntness_ratio\":1.15},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":277900,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":392.5,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"high\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Maps the (b, cone) hull and separates the cone effect from the bluntness effect.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-c99d80679c13\",\"rationale\":\"Bluntness 1.1 with cone 69.9. The existing b 1.1 point uses cone 67.5, so this isolates the cone effect.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"bluntness_ratio\":1.1},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":281000,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":393.1,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"high\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Shows whether a larger cone lowers flux at fixed b.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-ba66a1b43adf\",\"rationale\":\"Raise the cone from 67.5 to 68.5 at b 1.1 to test the cone gradient inside the hull.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"cone_half_angle_deg\":68.5},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":280000,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":393.0,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"high\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Cone-sensitivity information for later rounds.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0}]}","ttft_ms":121667,"type":"result","duration_ms":157949,"uuid":"82f96202-fadc-40ce-8409-ab76b8948b3f","ttft_stream_ms":1459,"time_to_request_ms":38,"first_content_frame_ms":1459,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
